#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tumor_immunity_analysis
#
# The governing rule of this repository: CODE travels through git, DATA never
# does. Every dataset lives on TACC under $SCRATCH and is reproducible from
# config/datasets_manifest.csv. Nothing in data/ is ever committed, from either
# side of the sync.
#
# The directories themselves ARE tracked, via .gitkeep, so that a fresh clone
# on a laptop has exactly the same paths as the TACC checkout. Code can then
# hardcode `data/raw/<GSEID>/` and be correct in both places -- empty locally,
# populated on Vista.
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

#--- Data trees: structure tracked, contents never -------------------------
# Ignore everything inside, then re-admit the .gitkeep that holds the dir.
data/**
!data/
!data/*/
!data/**/.gitkeep

#--- Claude Code local settings --------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
